# 26. PhonePe System Design Case Study

## 1. Problem statement

Design a simplified version of PhonePe that allows users to:

1. Register and log in.
2. Link their bank account.
3. Send money using UPI ID or QR code.
4. Receive money.
5. Check transaction history.
6. Receive payment status and notifications.
7. Handle failed, pending, and duplicate payments.

Important: This is an interview-oriented architecture, not PhonePe’s confidential internal architecture. PhonePe officially operates as a UPI Third-Party Application Provider (TPAP) through sponsor PSP banks and connects to the NPCI UPI ecosystem. ([PhonePe][1])

