# 4. How a payment works

Example:

> Noor sends ₹500 to a shopkeeper using a QR code.

## Step-by-step flow

```text
1. User scans QR code
          │
          ▼
2. App extracts receiver's UPI ID
          │
          ▼
3. App sends payment request
          │
          ▼
4. API Gateway authenticates user
          │
          ▼
5. Payment Service validates request
          │
          ▼
6. Create payment record: PENDING
          │
          ▼
7. Request goes to UPI Connector
          │
          ▼
8. PSP Bank → NPCI UPI Network
          │
          ▼
9. NPCI routes request to both banks
          │
          ▼
10. Payer Bank debits ₹500
          │
          ▼
11. Payee Bank credits ₹500
          │
          ▼
12. Payment response received
          │
          ▼
13. Update transaction: SUCCESS
          │
          ▼
14. Notify sender and receiver
```

The actual UPI transaction involves external banking and NPCI systems. PhonePe’s application is one participant in this ecosystem rather than the complete banking settlement system. ([PhonePe][1])

