# 12. Failure handling

## Case 1: NPCI or bank timeout

```text
Payment Request
      │
      ▼
Bank Timeout
      │
      ▼
Mark transaction PENDING
      │
      ▼
Retry status inquiry
      │
      ▼
Get final status
```

Do not blindly retry the entire debit operation. First check whether the original transaction succeeded.

## Case 2: Backend server crashes

The payment record should already be saved before calling the external payment provider.

```text
Create transaction → PENDING
              │
              ▼
Call payment provider
              │
              ▼
Server crashes
```

When the system restarts, a reconciliation worker can find pending transactions and check their status.

## Case 3: Duplicate callback

The payment provider might send the same callback more than once.

Solution:

```text
provider_reference must be UNIQUE
```

Process the first callback and safely ignore duplicate callbacks.

