# 13. Reconciliation system

Reconciliation compares the internal payment records with bank/provider records.

```text
PhonePe Transaction DB
          │
          ▼
   Reconciliation Job
          │
          ▼
Compare with Bank/NPCI Report
          │
    ┌─────┴─────┐
    ▼           ▼
 Matching    Mismatch
    │           │
    ▼           ▼
 Completed   Investigation
```

Example:

```text
Internal status: PENDING
Bank status: SUCCESS
```

The reconciliation system updates the internal record to `SUCCESS`.

This is important because payment systems can experience network failures, delayed callbacks, and inconsistent intermediate states.

