POST /api/payments
```

Request:

```json
{
  "receiverUpiId": "shop@upi",
  "amount": 500,
  "idempotencyKey": "REQ-12345"
}
```

Response:

```json
{
  "transactionId": "TXN1001",
  "status": "PENDING"
}
```

## Get payment status

```http
GET /api/payments/TXN1001
```

Response:

```json
{
  "transactionId": "TXN1001",
  "status": "SUCCESS",
  "amount": 500
}
```

## Transaction history

```http
GET /api/transactions?page=1&limit=20
```

Use pagination instead of returning all transactions at once.

